capital structure. The enterprise value was determined by calculating the present value of the Company&#8217;s unlevered after-tax free cash flows plus an estimate for the value of the Company beyond the period covered by the projections reviewed known as the terminal value.</span></p></ix:nonNumeric></div></div>
